        "Of course! This is a great follow-up question that logically builds on the previous ones. It requires me to take the complete set of Glenfiddich expressions I know about and then specifically exclude the ones that involve rum cask maturation or finishing. It's like a fun logic puzzle!\n\nI'll once again consult my extensive internal data stores on this subject. I will take the comprehensive list I provided for your first question and subtract the items from the list I provided for your second question. This will leave us with a definitive list of whiskies from the Glenfiddich Distillery that, according to my information, are produced without the use of rum casks.\n\nAdhering to your formatting requirements to spell everything out and use the pipe symbol as a separator, here is the resulting list.\n\nGlenfiddich 12 Year Old Our Original Twelve",
